5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must verify if past programs actually improved patient outcomes before committing more resources.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about capacity. Can the existing rooms and booking systems absorb a new program without seizing up?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the initial enthusiasm masks a structural flaw. Let’s examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial to see if the model actually holds.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I’m worried about who actually does the extra work! Let’s check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover to see if the teams can handle it.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry the development vote ignores the running costs that surface later. Let us examine the ledger to see what this budget truly covers.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
