52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Servas, precisely. The jointly run clinic failed because ownership was ambiguous. We must select a program with a single, internal department to prevent the second-year collapse.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas, I agree! We need a program that uses the midwifery slack and stays on-site. Let’s pick the one that fits our current staffing reality!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
